{"id":144086394150760,"type":"artist","name":"Black Box","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":11,"info":{"img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/5158bfabe33a347df53725ce39b4049e/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"Black Box fue un grupo musical formado a finales de la década de los 80, en Italia, por los productores Daniele Davoli, Mirko Limoni y Valerio Semplici. Se formaron como uno de los principales proyectos de Italo House, o Italo Disco. Los produtores también usaban diversos nombres, como Starlight y Groove Groove Melody.\n\nEl primer sencillo \"Ride on Time\" fue su mayor éxito, no sólo en Italia, sino en el mundo entero. Fue un sencillo muy vendido en Gran Bretaña en 1989.","tags":["dance","House","90s","eurodance","female vocalists"]},"works":[{"id":176852785724917,"type":"song","name":"Ride on Time","artist":"Black Box","year":1989,"weight":10,"yt":"M0quXl_od3g","src":"books,charts,singles","from":{"books":[{"name":"Loops 1 y 2","title":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica (Javier Blánquez (ed.))"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":280026104147222,"name":"UK Best Selling Singles","rank":null,"scaruffi":null},{"id":179984359651109,"name":"UK nº1 · 1980s","rank":633,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":146619765311683,"type":"album","name":"Dreamland","artist":"Black Box","year":1990,"weight":5,"yt":"W6dGqAqa6ng","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":125419932206873,"name":"RYM Top — Dance — Italo House","rank":1,"scaruffi":null},{"id":89537561555612,"name":"RYM Top — Dance — Diva House","rank":3,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":99304550615147,"type":"song","name":"Everybody Everybody","artist":"Black Box","year":1990,"weight":4,"yt":"18N2k1TBBRE","src":"charts,singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":83116008556051,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1990","rank":81,"scaruffi":null},{"id":132335824845498,"name":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","rank":81,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":23634567527